libftxf
------------------------------------------
libftxf is a library for Transactional NTFS (TxF) data types.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libcerror1-20260703-1bl1
  libftxf-devel-20260521-1bl1
  libftxf1-20260521-1bl1
  libfusn1-20260522-1bl1
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20260320-2
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  gettext-devel-0.22.5-1
  libcerror-devel-20260703-1bl1
  libcnotify-devel-20260703-1bl1
  libfdatetime-devel-20260521-1bl1
  libfguid-devel-20260521-1bl1
  libfusn-devel-20260522-1bl1
  libtool-2.6.2-1
  libuna-devel-20260602-1bl2
  make-4.4.1-2

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/libyal/libftxf

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/libyal/libftxf/archive/refs/tags/20260521.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libftxf-20260521-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libftxf-20260521-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libftxf-20260521-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libftxf-20260521-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libftxf1-20260521-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libftxf-devel-20260521-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(libftxf)
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/libftxf.README
  /usr/share/doc/libftxf/AUTHORS
  /usr/share/doc/libftxf/COPYING
  /usr/share/doc/libftxf/COPYING.LESSER
  /usr/share/doc/libftxf/ChangeLog
  /usr/share/doc/libftxf/README

(libftxf1)
  /usr/bin/cygftxf-1.dll

(libftxf-devel)
  /usr/include/libftxf.h
  /usr/include/libftxf/codepage.h
  /usr/include/libftxf/definitions.h
  /usr/include/libftxf/error.h
  /usr/include/libftxf/extern.h
  /usr/include/libftxf/features.h
  /usr/include/libftxf/types.h
  /usr/lib/libftxf.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/libftxf.pc
  /usr/share/man/man3/libftxf.3.gz

